    <!-- About -->
    <string name="title_about">About Noxs</string>
    <string name="about_body">Noxs is an original, Debian-optimized Linux userspace environment for Android. It was designed using public architectural concepts (terminal emulator + proot rootfs) and contains no code, branding, or assets from other projects.\n\ncode-server is optional and downloaded by the user under its own MIT license.\n\nNoxs is distributed under the Apache License 2.0.</string>
